Mesquite

This repository is a Rust translation of the tree-sitter runtime and of the tree-sitter
grammars listed below. Each is distributed under the MIT License, except
tree-sitter-astro-next, tree-sitter-elixir, tree-sitter-erlang and tree-sitter-hcl, which
are under the Apache License 2.0. Their copyright notices follow. The full license texts
are in runtime/LICENSE and tables/LICENSE (tree-sitter) and in grammars/<key>/LICENSE
(each grammar).

